<section class="section"><div class="container prose">
  <h2>1. Current approach</h2>
  <p>The website does not use advertising cookies or profiling for advertising purposes. The calculator, guidance tools and basic interactions run in the visitor’s browser.</p>
  <h2>2. Measurement technology review</h2>
  <p>The final measurement, storage and provider configuration must be checked before this policy is published. This version does not attribute privacy characteristics to a provider that has not been confirmed.</p>
  <h2>3. Future changes</h2>
  <p>If future tools such as analytics, advertising, embedded maps, video or other third-party services use cookies or equivalent technologies, this policy will be updated and the appropriate consent mechanism will be introduced before activation.</p>
  <h2>4. Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy and technology questions, email <a href="mailto:lopezmarquezabogados@gmail.com">lopezmarquezabogados@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</div></section>
